Tool response:
Tool: flag_duplicate_invoices
Description: Identify and flag duplicate invoices in a specified AP batch.

Scans invoices within the given AP batch for duplicates based on carrier SCAC code, 
invoice number, and total amount. Flags each duplicate with status 'DUPLICATE_DETECTED' 
and links it to the original invoice using the 'duplicate_of' reference.
Parameters:
    {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "batch_code": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "The batch code of the AP batch to scan for duplicates (e.g., 'AP-2024-Q3-07')",
          "title": "Batch Code"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "batch_code"
      ]
    }
